---
import PhotoPlaceholder from '../PhotoPlaceholder.astro';
import VisionFigure from '../VisionFigure.astro';
import SectionHead from '../SectionHead.astro';
---

<section class="band-ink section">
  <SectionHead num="8 / 14 — People" heading="When the Valley shrinks." />

  <div class="container-page">
    <PhotoPlaceholder
      variant="ink"
      description="A BRT car at midday — a wheelchair user already aboard, a senior with a cane, two teenagers, a hospitality worker in scrubs, a tourist with a backpack. The transit system as a public room."
    />
  </div>

  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div class="vision-prose">
      <p>
        There's a quiet test of how a city is built that nobody ever runs explicitly:
        <em>who can use it without driving?</em> In most of the Las&nbsp;Vegas Valley today, the answer
        is almost no one. The 14-year-old who wants to get to robotics club waits for a parent. The 78-year-old
        whose doctor took her keys away last year stays home unless someone visits. The wheelchair user
        can technically use the bus, but only if every curb cut on her route is working that day, which
        they often are not. The hospitality worker clocking out at 2&nbsp;a.m. waits forty-five minutes
        for a bus that may or may not be on schedule. None of these people has a smaller life because
        they are themselves smaller. They have smaller lives because the infrastructure around them was
        built for one mode and one type of trip.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container-page">
    <VisionFigure num="8" title="Who the Valley has to work for">
      <div class="archetype-row">
        <div class="archetype-cell">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 60 90"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <circle cx="30" cy="20" r="10"></circle><line x1="30" y1="30" x2="30" y2="60"></line>
            <line x1="30" y1="60" x2="20" y2="80"></line><line x1="30" y1="60" x2="40" y2="80"
            ></line>
            <line x1="20" y1="45" x2="40" y2="45"></line>
          </svg>
          <span class="archetype-label"><span class="archetype-age">14</span><br />Teenager</span>
        </div>
        <div class="archetype-cell">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 60 90"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <circle cx="30" cy="22" r="10"></circle><line x1="30" y1="32" x2="30" y2="62"></line>
            <line x1="30" y1="62" x2="22" y2="82"></line><line x1="30" y1="62" x2="38" y2="82"
            ></line>
            <line x1="22" y1="50" x2="42" y2="50"></line>
          </svg>
          <span class="archetype-label"><span class="archetype-age">35</span><br />Worker</span>
        </div>
        <div class="archetype-cell">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 60 90"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <circle cx="30" cy="22" r="10"></circle><line x1="30" y1="32" x2="30" y2="62"></line>
            <line x1="30" y1="62" x2="22" y2="82"></line><line x1="30" y1="62" x2="38" y2="82"
            ></line>
            <line x1="22" y1="50" x2="42" y2="50"></line><line x1="42" y1="50" x2="48" y2="80"
            ></line>
          </svg>
          <span class="archetype-label"><span class="archetype-age">78</span><br />Senior</span>
        </div>
        <div class="archetype-cell">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 60 90"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <circle cx="22" cy="30" r="8"></circle><line x1="22" y1="38" x2="22" y2="55"></line>
            <line x1="22" y1="55" x2="38" y2="55"></line><circle cx="42" cy="62" r="14"></circle>
            <circle cx="22" cy="78" r="6"></circle><circle cx="42" cy="78" r="6"></circle>
            <line x1="22" y1="55" x2="22" y2="72"></line><line x1="42" y1="55" x2="42" y2="68"
            ></line>
          </svg>
          <span class="archetype-label">Wheelchair<br />rider</span>
        </div>
        <div class="archetype-cell">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 60 90"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <circle cx="30" cy="22" r="10"></circle><line x1="30" y1="32" x2="30" y2="62"></line>
            <line x1="30" y1="62" x2="22" y2="82"></line><line x1="30" y1="62" x2="38" y2="82"
            ></line>
            <line x1="22" y1="50" x2="42" y2="50"></line><rect x="38" y="42" width="14" height="20"
            ></rect>
          </svg>
          <span class="archetype-label">Tourist</span>
        </div>
        <div class="archetype-cell">
          <svg
            viewBox="0 0 60 90"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <circle cx="30" cy="22" r="10"></circle><line x1="30" y1="32" x2="30" y2="62"></line>
            <line x1="30" y1="62" x2="22" y2="82"></line><line x1="30" y1="62" x2="38" y2="82"
            ></line>
            <line x1="22" y1="50" x2="42" y2="50"></line><line x1="14" y1="38" x2="46" y2="38"
            ></line>
          </svg>
          <span class="archetype-label">Hospitality<br />worker</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <Fragment slot="caption">
        Kids and seniors are the canary on every transit decision. If it works for them, it works
        for everybody.
      </Fragment>
    </VisionFigure>
  </div>

  <div class="container-narrow">
    <div class="vision-prose">
      <p>
        The Valley we're building is one where the same six riders move through it without
        performing extraordinary effort. The teenager has bus headways short enough to be
        spontaneous. The senior has a paratransit system that actually works and a bus stop she can
        reach. The wheelchair user has level boarding and reliable curb cuts. The hospitality worker
        has 24-hour service that runs on schedule. The tourist arrives at the airport and never
        needs a rental car. Every one of these people has a Valley they can actually move through,
        on their own terms.
      </p>
    </div>
    <p class="vision-tail">
      A Valley that works for the 14-year-old, the 78-year-old, and everyone in between — without
      anyone needing a car or a favor to get through their day.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .archetype-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: end;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .archetype-row {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1.5rem 1rem;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .archetype-row {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
  .archetype-cell {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .archetype-cell svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 80px;
    height: auto;
    color: currentColor;
  }
  .archetype-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  .archetype-age {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 800;
  }
</style>
